   The signature has only independent `[Field k₀] [Field Kres]`: no embedding \(k_0\to Kres\), no finiteness witness, and no compatibility between that embedding and `residueEmbed`. The residue-degree multiplication law and constructions \(K[Z]/(r)\) therefore lack their declared formal base.

